            "text": "A native pixel mismatch can be admitted only by an exact reviewed SHA pair keyed to the full platform and runner fingerprint. This mirrors Blink platform-theme ownership: a macOS pair cannot authorize Linux or Windows pixels, and an image or Chromium revision rotation invalidates the review automatically.",
            "markdown": "A native pixel mismatch can be admitted only by an exact reviewed SHA pair keyed to the full platform and runner fingerprint. This mirrors Blink platform-theme ownership: a macOS pair cannot authorize Linux or Windows pixels, and an image or Chromium revision rotation invalidates the review automatically."
